<title>USA: GPU to restore 850 MW Pa. coal plant today.</title>
<headline>GPU to restore 850 MW Pa. coal plant today.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPU Generation Inc said Thursday the 850 megawatt (MW) Canemaugh 2 coal-fired generation unit would return on line later today after being shut September 22 for seasonal maintenance.</p>
<p>The Conemaugh unit, in Indiana County in western Pennsylvania, is jointly owned by utility members of the Pennsylvania-New Jersey-Maryland Interconnect power pool.</p>
<p>The Conemaugh station is operated by GPU Generation, a subsidiary of General Public Utilities Corp of Parsippany, N.J.</p>
<p>--New York Power Desk 212-859-1622</p>
</text>
